    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master tactics and fulfil your galactic ambitions in a sci-fi strategy board game. Outsmart your enemies in hex-based tactical PvP duels, manage your expanding fleet, and join a faction to shape the fate of a fractured galaxy - one skirmish at a time.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753930/extras/c9d9efaf01ec082db452554588d7e02d.avif?t=1750147825\" data-has-big width=800 height=369 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic skirmishes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize various movement patterns and special abilities of your spaceships to outmanoeuvre your opponents in strategic turn-based PvP skirmishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753930/extras/185be3d3a072db07e2f44ffca4eef4f1.avif?t=1750147825\" data-has-big width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic campaign:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer sectors for your faction and become the dominant force in the galaxy. Engage your opponents in front-line skirmishes to push them out of sectors. Take part in larger drawn out support skirmishes to strengthen your faction and front-line fleet.\u00a0Your efforts influence an overarching community-driven narrative. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753930/extras/b73c370ea088b51adf5c6d9e1a00b2a6.avif?t=1750147825\" data-has-big width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Salvage and fleet management:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge opponents\u2019 destroyed spaceships and use the salvage to repair and upgrade your fleet or expand it further to engage in multiple skirmishes at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753930/extras/0c396663518fcabcd261081a2cfce0b0.avif?t=1750147825\" data-has-big width=800 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crew journey:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiences of every squad leader, captain and commander in your fleet are recorded in their personal logs and contribute to your fleet\u2019s history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional game modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge players to improve your global standing (ELO raiting) in classical Stellar Skirmish chess variant. Earn your place on the ranked leaderboards and take part in official tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge players in unranked online or local multiplayer matches and custom tournaments in classical Stellar Skirmish chess variant.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master tactics and fulfil your galactic ambitions in a sci-fi strategy board game. Outsmart your enemies in hex-based tactical PvP duels, manage your expanding fleet, and join a faction to shape the fate of a fractured galaxy - one skirmish at a time.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753930/extras/c9d9efaf01ec082db452554588d7e02d.avif?t=1750147825\" data-has-big width=800 height=369 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic skirmishes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize various movement patterns and special abilities of your spaceships to outmanoeuvre your opponents in strategic turn-based PvP skirmishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753930/extras/185be3d3a072db07e2f44ffca4eef4f1.avif?t=1750147825\" data-has-big width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic campaign:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer sectors for your faction and become the dominant force in the galaxy. Engage your opponents in front-line skirmishes to push them out of sectors. Take part in larger drawn out support skirmishes to strengthen your faction and front-line fleet.\u00a0Your efforts influence an overarching community-driven narrative. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753930/extras/b73c370ea088b51adf5c6d9e1a00b2a6.avif?t=1750147825\" data-has-big width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Salvage and fleet management:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge opponents\u2019 destroyed spaceships and use the salvage to repair and upgrade your fleet or expand it further to engage in multiple skirmishes at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753930/extras/0c396663518fcabcd261081a2cfce0b0.avif?t=1750147825\" data-has-big width=800 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crew journey:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiences of every squad leader, captain and commander in your fleet are recorded in their personal logs and contribute to your fleet\u2019s history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional game modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge players to improve your global standing (ELO raiting) in classical Stellar Skirmish chess variant. Earn your place on the ranked leaderboards and take part in official tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge players in unranked online or local multiplayer matches and custom tournaments in classical Stellar Skirmish chess variant.</p>",
